    matrix: `Tensor` of shape `[..., M, N]`.
    rhs: `Tensor` of shape `[..., M, K]`.
    l2_regularizer: 0-D `double` `Tensor`. Ignored if `fast=False`.
    fast: bool. Defaults to `True`.
